sequenceDiagram
  actor F as Facilitator
  participant W as Next.js web
  participant A as Auth service
  participant L as Library service
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant M as Media signer

  F->>W: GET /workspace
  W->>A: Validate server session
  A-->>W: Account + active entitlement
  W->>L: Get current full deck(locale)
  L->>D: Read active immutable version
  D-->>L: Cards + approved translation
  L->>M: Create scoped media DTOs
  M-->>L: Versioned media URLs
  L-->>W: Deck DTO + ETag
  W-->>F: Server shell + workspace island
